nitor)\n\n- [Issues](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/issues)\n\n- [Pull requests](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/pulls)\n\n- [Actions](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/actions)\n\n- [Projects](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/projects)\n\n- [Wiki](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/wiki)\n\n- [Security and quality](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/security)\n\n- [Insights](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/pulse)\n\n /Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor\n\n## FilesExpand file tree\n\n master\n\n## Breadcrumbs\n\n- [ai-goofish-monitor](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/tree/master)\n/\n# README.md\n\nCopy path\n\nBlameMore file actions\n\nBlameMore file actions\n\n## Latest commit\n \n\n## History\n[History](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/commits/master/README.md)\n/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/commits/master/README.mdHistory\n\n326 lines (224 loc) · 11.4 KB\n\n master\n\n## Breadcrumbs\n\n- [ai-goofish-monitor](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/tree/master)\n/\n# README.md\n\nTop\n\n## File metadata and controls\n\n- Preview\n- Code\n- Blame\n326 lines (224 loc) · 11.4 KB\n\n[Raw](https://github.com/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/raw/refs/heads/master/README.md)\nCopy raw file\nDownload raw file\n\nOutlineEdit and raw actions\n\n# 闲鱼智能监控机器人\n#闲鱼智能监控机器人\n\n[English README](/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/blob/master/README_EN.md)\n\n基于 Playwright 和 AI 的闲鱼多任务实时监控工具，提供完整的 Web 管理界面。\n\n## 核心特性\n#核心特性\n\n- Web 可视化管理: 任务管理、账号管理、AI 标准编辑、运行日志、结果浏览\n\n- AI 驱动: 自然语言创建任务，多模态模型深度分析商品\n\n- 多任务并发: 独立配置关键词、价格、筛选条件和 AI Prompt\n\n- 高级筛选: 包邮、新发布时间范围、省/市/区三级区域筛选\n\n- 即时通知: 支持 ntfy.sh、企业微信、Bark、Telegram、Webhook\n\n- 定时调度: Cron 表达式配置周期性任务\n\n- 账号与代理轮换: 多账号管理、任务绑定账号、代理池轮换与失败重试\n\n- Docker 部署: 一键容器化部署\n\n## 截图\n#截图\n\n/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/blob/master/static/img.png\n/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/blob/master/static/img_1.png\n/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/blob/master/static/img_2.png\n/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor/blob/master/static/img_3.png\n\n## 🐳 Docker 部署（推荐）\n#-docker-部署推荐\n\ngit clone https://github.com/Usagi-org/ai-goofish-monitor && cd ai-goofish-monitor\ncp .env.example .env\nvim .env # 填写相关配置项\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose logs -f app\ndocker compose down\n\n如果镜像无法访问或下载速度慢，可尝试使用加速：\n\ndocker pull ghcr.nju.edu.cn/usagi-org/ai-goofish:latest\ndocker tag ghcr.nju.edu.cn/usagi-org/ai-goofish:latest ghcr.io/usagi-org/ai-goofish:latest\ndocker compose up -d\n\n- 默认 Web UI 地址：http://127.0.0.1:8000\n\n- Docker 镜像已内置 Chromium，无需宿主机额外安装浏览器。\n\n- 官方镜像地址：ghcr.io/usagi-org/ai-goofish:latest\n\n- 更新镜像：docker compose pull && docker compose up -d\n\n- 如果你修改了 .env 中的 SERVER_PORT，请同步更新 docker-compose.yaml 里的端口映射。\n\n- docker-compose.yaml 默认会把 SQLite 主库挂载到 ./data:/app/data，数据库文件默认为 data/app.sqlite3\n\n- 目前默认持久化这些目录：\n\ndata/ SQLi\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fcee7b4c4102bf88\">>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775454548003}}
