{"type":"message","id":"ddec287c","parentId":"a6eb91a3","timestamp":"2026-04-06T05:56:03.739Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Docker Desktop Linux engine is returning a 500 Internal Server Error. This is the same issue we saw earlier with `docker version`. The Docker Desktop application is running (we saw the processes), but the actual Docker Linux engine inside it is not responding properly.\n\nThis is a Docker Desktop issue, not a problem with our docker-compose.yaml. The user needs to restart Docker Desktop.\n\nLet me inform the user about this issue and ask them to restart Docker Desktop.","thinkingSignature":"595f4cc868f1d30f9b9a96483061faaa3b964ba4836b84d6d92dbc7dee4096b0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n遇到了 Docker Desktop 的问题——**Docker Linux 引擎没有正常响应**（返回 500 Internal Server Error）。这是之前 `docker version` 报错一样的原因。\n\n**需要你手动重启 Docker Desktop：**\n\n1. 点右下角系统托盘的 🐳 Docker Desktop 图标\n2. 右键 → **Restart**（或者 Quit 再重新打开 Docker Desktop）\n3. 等 Docker Desktop 完全启动后，再告诉我，我来继续部署\n\n重启完成后 Docker Desktop 的 Linux 引擎就正常了，镜像拉取和启动就能继续。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26728,"output":206,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59768,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775454956009,"responseId":"06227dec11979428c5ffb695f70280b1"}}
